uira_essaouira_ramparts","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":3,"commonsNearby":242,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["essaouiraramparts","essaouira"],"names":{"de":"Mogador","fr":"Enceinte fortifée de Mogador"},"unesco":true,"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/At_the_Beach_in_Essaouira_%284263501838%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/At_the_Beach_in_Essaouira_%284263501838%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"Alex Proimos from Sydney, Australia","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:At_the_Beach_in_Essaouira_(4263501838).jpg"}},{"id":"essaouira_mogador_island","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Mogador island","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":31.49594,"lng":-9.78681},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"essaouira_mogador_island","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["mogadorisland","essaouira"],"summary":"It's a nature reserve, and thus can't be visited without an official authorization. In the 19th century, it was used as a quarantine station for pilgrims returning from Mecca.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira","names":{"de":"Mogador","fr":"Île de Mogador","es":"Isla de Mogador"},"unesco":true,"photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Mogador_Iles_purpuraires_0001.jpg/1280px-Mogador_Iles_purpuraires_0001.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Mogador_Iles_purpuraires_0001.jpg/500px-Mogador_Iles_purpuraires_0001.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"Christian Pirkl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mogador_Iles_purpuraires_0001.jpg"}},{"id":"essaouira_wv_the_nearby_town_of_diabat","areaId":"essaouira","name":"The nearby town of Diabat","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":31.481,"lng":-9.77},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_the_nearby_town_of_diabat","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["thenearbytownofdiabat","essaouira"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"is at the south end of Essaouira's beach, and is allegedly where Jimi Hendrix once spent some time. Even if the stories aren't true, this long, windswept beach with its ruined fort is a fantastic walk. Diabat is an empty, concrete Berber village that is practically devoid of attractions except the Hendrix ruin and a Hendrix Café. It's best visited in the early morning via taxi and then return to E","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_dar_sultan_palace","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Dar Sultan Palace","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":31.4836,"lng":-9.7691},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_dar_sultan_palace","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["darsultanpalace","essaouira"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Walk south along the beach, cross the shallow river Oued Igrounzer and in the hills to your left you will see the ruins of a once magnificent 18th century palace used by Sultans and Kings. A path leads there; you can still find some old floor mosaics and thankfully the ruins offer some shade.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_shyadma_s_vegan_food","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Shyadma's Vegan Food","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":31.51386,"lng":-9.77103},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_shyadma_s_vegan_food","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["shyadmasveganfood","essaouira"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Lovely vegan/vegetarian spot in the middle of Place El Khayma, a less visited place with many restaurants. Shyadma's is tiny, but everything is made from seasonal vegetables and fruits from the nearby market. You will most likely have to wait 15-20 minutes for your food, but it's well worth the wait. If you call this Moroccan slow food, you will be very right. A refreshing delight for foodies, esp","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_fish_market","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Fish Market","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":31.50949,"lng":-9.77433},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_fish_market","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["fishmarket","essaouira"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"If you are a fish enthusiast, you should not miss the food in the market. Buy your fish (cheap, shrimps are 50 dirham/kilo, sardines 5-6 dirham) take it to the small kitchen/restaurant and let them cook it for you. They add salad, olives and bread for 25 dirham.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_la_decouverte","areaId":"essaouira","name":"La Decouverte","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":31.51295,"lng":-9.77086},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_la_decouverte","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.essaouira-ladecouverte.com","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["ladecouverte","essaouira"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"If you are tired of tagines, disappointed by Italian-Moroccan pasta, give La Decouverte a try. A French couple cook in a Moroccan style but with a French twist. Nice atmosphere, good prices.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_taros","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Taros","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":31.51227,"lng":-9.77207},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_taros","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["tarosessaouira","essaouira"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Combines a French-Moroccan restaurant, a gallery and a terrace bar with live local music and \"5\" (rue Youssef el fassi) for its elegant ex-pat vibe.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Essaouira"},{"id":"essaouira_wv_il_mare","areaId":"essaouira","name":"Il Mare","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":31.51493,"lng":-9.77195},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"essaouira_wv_il_mare","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["ilmare","essaouira"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Has a nice terrace with a view o